'''
The frontman in a sewer, in side view: an original character in a black coat with spiky hair, leaning far forward over a mic stand
tilted 45 degrees, both hands on the mic, legs spread, screaming into it. A big pipe over his back pours mud; the mud runs down him,
piles up around his feet and spreads out.

Layers (bottom first): pool_back; the singer: legs_back, arm_back, coat, stand, legs_front, head, face (artlib symbols), hair, arm_front,
mic; mud and mud2 (hanging curtains of mud with chunks, blobs and wet highlights, clipped to the singer's body layers); stream (mud
from the pipe), pipe, pool (the heap on the floor, over his feet), drips_chin / drips_arm / drips_hem (hanging drips) and drops.

The mud story is animated with CSS @keyframes on the layers (see SPEC.md, "Animation"): singer(t=seconds) is the picture at that time,
a 60 second story:   0s clean | 3s the pipe starts to pour | 10s a puddle spreads at his feet | 11s..54s the mud climbs him
                     | 30s..60s drips hang from his chin, arm and coat | 40s.. drops fall.   singer() without t is the clean picture.
Play it slower or faster with the speed of the tile: kmj("singer.kmj", "singer", fps=24, seconds=240, speed=0.25).
'''

@keyframes pour {
    0%, 4%  { scale: 1 0.01; opacity: 0 }
    5%      { scale: 1 0.02; opacity: 1 }
    18%     { scale: 1 1; opacity: 1 }
    100%    { scale: 1 1; opacity: 1 }
}
@keyframes spread {
    0%, 14% { scale: 0.02 0.02; opacity: 0 }
    15%     { scale: 0.25 0.15; opacity: 1 }
    100%    { scale: 1.1 1; opacity: 1 }
}
@keyframes spread_back {
    0%, 14% { scale: 0.02 0.02; opacity: 0 }
    15%     { scale: 0.2 0.1; opacity: 1 }
    100%    { scale: 1.15 0.85; opacity: 1 }
}
@keyframes cover  { 0%, 18% { shift: 0 -62 } 100% { shift: 0 0 } }
@keyframes cover2 { 0%, 40% { shift: 0 -62 } 100% { shift: 0 0 } }
@keyframes hang {
    0%      { scale: 1 0.01; opacity: 0 }
    4%      { scale: 1 0.05; opacity: 1 }
    100%    { scale: 1 1; opacity: 1 }
}
@keyframes fall {
    0%      { shift: 0 -6; opacity: 0 }
    15%     { opacity: 1 }
    85%     { opacity: 1 }
    100%    { shift: 0 22; opacity: 0 }
}

